    {
      "id": "A1-24-L2",
      "position": 2,
      "skill": "grammar",
      "title": "قاعدة: he / she + verb-s (He wakes up at six)",
      "est_minutes": 15,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "audio",
          "text_en": "I wake up at six. He wakes up at six. She studies every day. We always eat breakfast."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "markdown_ar": "مع **I / you / we / they** الفعل يبقى كما هو: I **wake** up, we **study**.\n\nأما مع **he / she / it** فنضيف **s** في آخر الفعل:\n- I wake up → He wake**s** up.\n- I study → She stud**ies** (ننقل y إلى ies).\n- I wash → He wash**es** (بعد sh و ch نضيف es).\n\nكلمات التكرار:\n- **every day** = كل يوم (تأتي في آخر الجملة)\n- **always** = دائماً (تأتي قبل الفعل): I **always** pray.\n\n**الخطأ الشائع:** «He wake up». الصحيح: **He wakes up**."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "I / we / they",
            "he / she",
            "القاعدة"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
